{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56585","headline":"大还丹口诀 · 若讷","name":"大还丹口诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄芽砂汞造，阴殻含阳花。\n不得黄芽理，还丹应路赊。\n世人炼至药，尽认铅黄花。\n黄花是死物，那得到仙家。\n黄芽非外药，内象取精华。\n若到黄芽地，金银徒尔夸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"若讷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}